+          # WalletConnect Verify API code (dashboard.reown.com → project →
+          # Domains). Without it the APK ships with the placeholder and
+          # every Trust / MetaMask connection from the Android app reads
+          # "Unverified domain" even after the dashboard registered the
+          # domain. Set this in repository secrets as
+          # `WALLETCONNECT_VERIFY_CODE`. A missing value here is NOT a
+          # build error: the placeholder ships and the build still
+          # succeeds; the warning is loud so it cannot be missed.
+          WALLETCONNECT_VERIFY_CODE: ${{ secrets.WALLETCONNECT_VERIFY_CODE }}

       # Upload whatever was produced. `if-no-files-found: ignore` on the AAB
